<div style="width:640px; box-sizing:border-box; padding:36px 34px 32px; background:#f8f6f2; border-left:3px solid #3f7d7a;">
  <p class="lbl" style="color:#3f7d7a; margin-bottom:8px;">Case two · what the team built</p>
  <p class="disp" style="font-size:26px; margin-bottom:8px;">Four rounds, against the same task set</p>
  <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.65; color:#6b6057; margin:0 0 28px;">System Usability Scale, measured round by round on a fixed set of EV tasks.</p>

  <div style="display:flex; gap:12px;">
    <div style="width:34px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; height:250px; padding-bottom:2px;">
      <p class="num cap" style="font-size:11px; color:#b5a08a;">90</p>
      <p class="num cap" style="font-size:11px; color:#b5a08a;">75</p>
      <p class="num cap" style="font-size:11px; color:#b5a08a;">60</p>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-grow:1;">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 540 250" width="540" height="250" style="display:block;" aria-label="SUS scores rising across rounds">
        <rect x="420" y="0" width="120" height="250" fill="#efe9e1"></rect>
        <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="540" y2="0" stroke="#e8e2da" stroke-width="1"></line>
        <line x1="0" y1="125" x2="540" y2="125" stroke="#e8e2da" stroke-width="1"></line>
        <line x1="0" y1="249" x2="540" y2="249" stroke="#d8cec0" stroke-width="1"></line>

        <line x1="0" y1="33" x2="540" y2="33" stroke="#b07a3c" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 5"></line>
        <line x1="0" y1="183" x2="540" y2="183" stroke="#b5a08a" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 5"></line>

        <polyline points="70,142 210,92 350,83" fill="none" stroke="#3f7d7a" stroke-width="2.5"></polyline>
        <circle cx="70" cy="142" r="6" fill="#3f7d7a"></circle>
        <circle cx="210" cy="92" r="6" fill="#3f7d7a"></circle>
        <circle cx="350" cy="83" r="6" fill="#3f7d7a"></circle>
        <line x1="480" y1="70" x2="480" y2="249" stroke="#c9bfb2" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 4"></line>

        <text x="70" y="128" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="600" fill="#1e1a16">73</text>
        <text x="210" y="78" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="600" fill="#1e1a16">79</text>
        <text x="350" y="69" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="600" fill="#1e1a16">80</text>
        <text x="536" y="27" text-anchor="end" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#b07a3c">TARGET 86</text>
        <text x="536" y="177" text-anchor="end" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="600" fill="#b5a08a">GLOBAL AVERAGE 68</text>
      </svg>
      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); margin-top:8px;">
        <p class="lbl" style="color:#8a7d6e; text-align:center;">Round 1</p>
        <p class="lbl" style="color:#8a7d6e; text-align:center;">Round 2</p>
        <p class="lbl" style="color:#8a7d6e; text-align:center;">Round 3</p>
        <p class="lbl" style="color:#b5a08a; text-align:center;">Round 4</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#8a7d6e; margin:22px 0 0; padding-top:16px; border-top:1px solid #e8e2da;">Three reported SUS scores across the testing programme. The fourth round was run to task-completion target rather than to a further SUS reading. Task completion lifted on every key task: battery status, schedules, home charging, public charging, payment.</p>

  <div style="margin-top:18px; display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:flex-start;">
    <div style="width:9px; height:9px; border:1.5px solid #b07a3c; border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:5px; background:#b07a3c;"></div>
    <p style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#1e1a16; margin:0;">Mine: funding four rounds against a delivery schedule, and holding the ship gate until performance hit target.</p>
  </div>
</div>
